# Keep text files consistent for everyone who clones this.
# The script itself must stay pure ASCII: Windows PowerShell 5.1 parses a
# BOM-less .ps1 as ANSI, so a single non-ASCII byte in a comment corrupts it on
# a Chinese-locale machine. i18n lives in JSON for exactly that reason.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
